# === Husky git-hook scripts (keep tracked — needed for commit-lint + pre-commit) ===
# The .husky/ pattern above ignores the whole folder; these exceptions let
# the two hook scripts stay tracked for contributors to get the same hooks.
!.husky/commit-msg
!.husky/pre-commit

# === Private contact / identity files (hybrid naming policy) ===
# Legal identity behind the "Fiavaion" trading name is held privately,
# disclosed to funders / HEIs on written request. Must never be committed.
CONTACT.private.md
*.private.md
*.private.txt

# === Funding / grant proposal drafts ===
# Drafts contain pre-submission budget negotiations and unconfirmed
# partner-HEI candidates. Gitignored pre-submission. A committed
# "submitted" folder can be added after the proposal lands.
docs/funding/
